@RaceDay_HostAddress = http://localhost:5294

### Health
GET {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Register (public)
POST {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "phone": "0123456789"
}

### Login (public) - will set auth cookie when run in a client that supports cookies
POST {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Get current user (requires cookie)
GET {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Create event (Organiser only) - requires cookie for an organiser
POST {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventName": "Sample Race",
  "eventDate": "2026-10-01T09:00:00Z",
  "location": "Central Park",
  "distance": 10.0,
  "eventTypeID": 1
}

### Get events
GET {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/events

### Enrol (Participant only)
POST {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventID": 1,
  "categoryID": 1
}

### Create result (Organiser only)
POST {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentID": 1,
  "finishTime": "00:45:30",
  "finishingPosition": 1
}

###
